        "original_id": "251b2117-960e-5253-9fac-a4e3cc723138",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eddie Leonski, Mary Charleston\n- Products: Death of a Soldier, Prisoner, The Last Outlaw\n- Places: Melbourne, Australia\n- Topics: serial killers, Australian film, television roles\n\nFacts:\n- Edward Joseph Leonski was born on December 12, 1917.\n- Eddie Leonski was an American soldier and serial killer who strangled three women in Melbourne, Australia.\n- Edward Joseph Leonski died on November 9, 1942.\n- In the 1970s and early 1980s, Mary Charleston guest starred on several television films and series.\n- In 1980, Mary Charleston appeared in the television miniseries The Last Outlaw.\n- Mary Charleston is best remembered for playing Linda Goldman in the cult soap opera Prisoner.\n- In 1986, Death of a Soldier was released as an Australian film based on the life of Eddie Leonski.\n- In 1986, Mary Charleston appeared in the war film Death of a Soldier.",
